<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>NaijaReach — Reach the right audience in Nigeria</title>
<meta name="description" content="NaijaReach helps Nigerian businesses create ad campaigns and choose exactly who sees them.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="container nav">
    <a href="index.html" class="logo">NaijaReach<span class="dot">.</span></a>
    <button class="nav-toggle" data-nav-toggle aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
    <nav class="nav-links" data-nav-links>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="campaign.html">Advertise</a>
      <a href="ads.html">Advertisements</a>
      <a href="admin.html">Admin</a>
      <a href="campaign.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm nav-cta">Create Campaign</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-eyebrow">Advertising for Nigerian businesses</div>
        <h1>Put your business in front of the people who'll actually buy.</h1>
        <p class="lead">NaijaReach lets you build an ad campaign in minutes and choose exactly who sees it — by location, category and audience — without guesswork.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="campaign.html" class="btn btn-gold">Create Campaign</a>
          <a href="ads.html" class="btn btn-ghost">See example ads</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reach-panel">
        <h3>Sample audience reach by segment</h3>
        <div class="reach-row">
          <span class="label">Students</span>
          <span class="reach-track"><span class="reach-fill" style="width:72%"></span></span>
          <span class="pct">72%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="reach-row">
          <span class="label">Business owners</span>
          <span class="reach-track"><span class="reach-fill" style="width:58%"></span></span>
          <span class="pct">58%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="reach-row">
          <span class="label">Shoppers</span>
          <span class="reach-track"><span class="reach-fill" style="width:81%"></span></span>
          <span class="pct">81%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="reach-row">
          <span class="label">Entrepreneurs</span>
          <span class="reach-track"><span class="reach-fill" style="width:64%"></span></span>
          <span class="pct">64%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="small-print" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55); margin-top:14px; margin-bottom:0;">Illustrative figures for this prototype — not live audience data.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>How it works</h2>
        <p>From idea to a campaign your customers can see, in four steps.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Create your campaign</h3>
            <p>Tell us about your business and what you're advertising.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Choose your audience</h3>
            <p>Pick a location, category and audience so the right people see it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <div>
            <h3>We review it</h3>
            <p>Our team checks every campaign before it goes live.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">4</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Your ad goes live</h3>
            <p>Once approved, your advert appears on NaijaReach.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ADVERTISE WITH US -->
  <section style="background:var(--paper); border-top:1px solid var(--border); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="container split">
      <div>
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Advertise with us</h2>
          <p>Whether you sell food, fashion, or software, NaijaReach gives you control over who sees your message — without a huge budget or a marketing team.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="campaign.html" class="btn btn-primary">Start your campaign</a>
      </div>
      <div class="advertise-panel">
        <ul class="benefit-list">
          <li><span class="mark"></span><div><strong>No minimum budget</strong>Set whatever campaign budget works for your business.</div></li>
          <li><span class="mark"></span><div><strong>Built for Nigerian businesses</strong>Categories and audiences that match how you actually sell.</div></li>
          <li><span class="mark"></span><div><strong>See it before you commit</strong>Preview your advert before you submit your campaign.</div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BENEFITS -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Why businesses choose NaijaReach</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="benefit-list" style="max-width:640px;">
        <li><span class="mark"></span><div><strong>Precise targeting fields</strong>Set country, city and audience so your campaign is built for the customer you want.</div></li>
        <li><span class="mark"></span><div><strong>Clear campaign status</strong>Know exactly whether your campaign is pending, approved or rejected.</div></li>
        <li><span class="mark"></span><div><strong>Simple, honest reporting</strong>An estimated reach figure so you know roughly what to expect.</div></li>
        <li><span class="mark"></span><div><strong>Fast to set up</strong>Launch a campaign in the time it takes to have a cup of tea.</div></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- EXAMPLE ADS -->
  <section style="background:var(--paper); border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Live on NaijaReach</h2>
        <p>A few of the campaigns currently running.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ad-grid" id="homeAdGrid"></div>
      <div class="mt-24">
        <a href="ads.html" class="btn btn-outline">View all advertisements</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="footer-logo">NaijaReach</div>
        <p class="footer-note">A prototype advertising platform helping Nigerian businesses reach the audience that matters to them.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Platform</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="campaign.html">Create Campaign</a></li>
          <li><a href="ads.html">Advertisements</a></li>
          <li><a href="admin.html">Admin</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Company</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Terms</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <span>© 2026 NaijaReach. Prototype — not a live service.</span>
      <span>Made in Nigeria</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
